[{"answer":"Hello, Picturerep. Can I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, hi.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I saw your advertisement about copying pictures to disk","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/3.mp3"},{"answer":"and I'd like a bit more information about what you do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure. What would you like to know?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I've got a box full of old family photos that's been up in the attic for years,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/6.mp3"},{"answer":"some of them must be 50 or 60 years old,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/7.mp3"},{"answer":"and I'd like to get them converted to digital format.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure, we can do that for you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/10.mp3"},{"answer":"And what about size?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/11.mp3"},{"answer":"The photos are all sorts of sizes - are there any restrictions?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Well the maximum size of photo we can do with our normal service is 30 centimetres.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/13.mp3"},{"answer":"And each picture must be at least 4 centimetres,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/14.mp3"},{"answer":"that's the minimum we can cope with.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/15-2023-02-28-15-23-10.mp3"},{"answer":"That should be fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/16.mp3"},{"answer":"And some of them are in a frame,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/17.mp3"},{"answer":"should I take them out before I send them?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes please, we can't copy them otherwise.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/19.mp3"},{"answer":"And also the photos must all be separate,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/20.mp3"},{"answer":"they mustn't be stuck into an album.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/21-2023-02-28-15-24-17.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, that's not a problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/22.mp3"},{"answer":"So can you give me an idea of how much this will cost?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I've got about 360 photos I think.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/24.mp3"},{"answer":"We charge £195 for 300 to 400 photos for the basic service.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/25.mp3"},{"answer":"OK. And does that include the disk?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, one disk.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/27.mp3"},{"answer":"But you can get extra ones for £5 each.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/28.mp3"},{"answer":"That's good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/29.mp3"},{"answer":"So do I need to pay when I send you the photos?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/30.mp3"},{"answer":"No, we won't need anything until we've actually copied the pictures.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Then we'll let you know how much it is,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/32.mp3"},{"answer":"and once we've received the payments, we'll send the parcel off to you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/33-2023-02-28-15-26-11.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Is there anything else you'd like to ask about our services?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/36.mp3"},{"answer":"I've roughly sorted out the photos into groups, according to what they're about.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/37.mp3"},{"answer":"So can you keep them in those groups when you copy them?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/39.mp3"},{"answer":"We'll save each group in a different folder on the disk and if you like, you can suggest a name for each folder.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/40.mp3"},{"answer":"So I could have one called 'Grandparents' for instance?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Exactly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/42.mp3"},{"answer":"And do you do anything besides scan the photos?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Like, can you make any improvements?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, in the standard service each photo is checked,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/45.mp3"},{"answer":"and we can sometimes touch up the colour a bit, or improve the contrast -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/46.mp3"},{"answer":"that can make a big difference.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/47.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/48.mp3"},{"answer":"And some of the photos are actually quite fragile -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/49.mp3"},{"answer":"they won't get damaged in the process, will they?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/50.mp3"},{"answer":"No, if any look particularly fragile, we'd do them by hand.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/51.mp3"},{"answer":"We do realise how precious these old photos can be.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/53.mp3"},{"answer":"And another thing is we can make changes to a photo if you want -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/54.mp3"},{"answer":"so if you want to remove an object from a photo,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/55.mp3"},{"answer":"or maybe alter the background, we can do that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Really?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/57.mp3"},{"answer":"I might be interested in that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/58.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll have a look through the photos and see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, and talking of fixing photos -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/60.mp3"},{"answer":"I've got a few that aren't properly in focus.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Can you do anything to make that better?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/62.mp3"},{"answer":"No, I'm afraid that's one thing we can't do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/63.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Any other information I can give you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/65.mp3"},{"answer":"...oh, how long will it all take?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/66.mp3"},{"answer":"We aim to get the copying done in ten days.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, well I'll get the photos packed up in a box and post them off to you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Right. If you've got a strong cardboard box, that's best.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/70.mp3"},{"answer":"We've found that plastic ones sometimes break in the post.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/71.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, thanks for your help. Bye.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Bye.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-2-part-1-2022-12-31-23-02-16/74.mp3"}]
